# Public client configuration only. Provider credentials belong in server/.env.
# Blank is valid ONLY in Expo development mode:
# - iOS simulator: http://127.0.0.1:3001 (backend on the same Mac)
# - Android emulator: http://10.0.2.2:3001
# - Web: http://<browser hostname>:3001
# For an explicit iOS simulator override, set the value to http://127.0.0.1:3001.
# Physical phone: use the development computer's reachable LAN address.
# Release builds: set a deployed HTTPS base URL, without a trailing /api.
# Never put an API provider key, session token or password in an EXPO_PUBLIC value.
# Fully reload the app after changing this value; rebuild installed release binaries.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
